<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Molinos says 1996 net $20.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Molinos says 1996 net $20.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of Argentine pesos.)</p>
<p>    Net			20.7   vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Revs		  1,215.4   vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Net assets		n/a</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Molinos Rio de la Plata. The company said its board will propose distributing $6.2 million in cash dividends to shareholders. Sales rose by six percent year-on-year. Net profits represented a 6.6 return on net assets.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
